WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.960
When you open KiddieTrac, you land on your home screen. It's a live look at your child's day.

2
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:15.610
The cards at the top show where your child is today, your balance this month, new photos, and anything waiting for you.

3
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:23.260
If you have more than one child, tap a name to switch between them. Each child has their own day.

4
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:30.750
Under your child's name, you can see whether they're at the centre or at home, their room, and who their educator is.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.670
Use the arrows beside the date to look back at an earlier day.

6
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:45.410
Scroll down for the day's story. It's a short summary of the day, written from everything the educators logged, and it's ready by the evening.

7
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:54.480
The counts for meals, naps, changes and play update the moment an educator logs them. Tap one to see just those moments.

8
00:00:54.730 --> 00:01:04.490
Keep scrolling for every moment of the day in order, from drop-off to pick-up, with any photos along the way. Tap a photo to see it full size.

9
00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:10.300
And the bar at the bottom takes you to Photos, Messenger and Billing whenever you need them.
